<div class="page-about__content">
  <p>We started as a small team of plant lovers frustrated by how hard it was to find genuinely sustainable gardening tools. Everywhere we looked, we saw plastic-heavy products, green-washed marketing, and tools designed to be thrown away.</p>

  <p>So we built something better.</p>

  <p>Today, EcoGrow Co. curates the world's best eco-friendly gardening products — from biodegradable nursery bags to solar-powered garden lighting — so you can grow the garden of your dreams without compromise.</p>
</div>

<section class="mission-section">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: var(--page-width); margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 var(--spacing-sm);">
    <h2 style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: var(--spacing-lg);">Our Mission</h2>
    <p style="text-align: center; font-size: 1.25rem; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto var(--spacing-lg); font-family: var(--font-heading); color: var(--color-primary);">
      Make sustainable gardening accessible, affordable, and utterly delightful.
    </p>

    <div class="mission-grid">
      <div class="mission-item">
        <div class="mission-item__icon">🌿</div>
        <div>
          <h4>Eco-Friendly Materials</h4>
          <p>Bamboo, bioplastics, recycled materials, and natural fibers — every product is vetted for genuine sustainability.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="mission-item">
        <div class="mission-item__icon">🛠️</div>
        <div>
          <h4>Real Utility</h4>
          <p>Tools that actually solve problems for gardeners. No gimmicks, no greenwashing, just quality you can count on.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="mission-item">
        <div class="mission-item__icon">⏳</div>
        <div>
          <h4>Longevity</h4>
          <p>Products built to last, not to landfill. We believe the most sustainable product is the one you don't have to replace.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="mission-item">
        <div class="mission-item__icon">💰</div>
        <div>
          <h4>Fair Value</h4>
          <p>Premium quality at fair prices, never green-washed markups. Sustainable shouldn't mean expensive.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="page-about__content" style="text-align: center; padding-top: 0;">
  <p>We're not perfect — sustainability is a journey, not a destination — but we're committed to learning, improving, and growing alongside you.</p>
  <p>Whether you're propagating your first pothos cutting or planning a full kitchen garden, we're here to help you grow greener.</p>
  <p style="font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 1.25rem; color: var(--color-primary);">— The EcoGrow Co. Team 🌱</p>
</div>

